WEBVTT

01:31.420 --> 01:35.830
<b>#7 The Secretary Does Her Best</b>

01:31.830 --> 01:34.750
Hello? Zenia? I'm back!

01:37.540 --> 01:38.830
That's strange...

01:38.830 --> 01:39.920
What's wrong?

01:39.920 --> 01:42.000
It seems Zenia isn't here.

01:42.000 --> 01:44.210
She usually comes running
when I call her name...

01:44.210 --> 01:46.380
Probably went shopping or whatever.

01:46.380 --> 01:47.790
In that outfit of hers...

01:48.250 --> 01:51.880
Before we left, I'd asked her
to look into something for me...

01:52.210 --> 01:53.040
<b>Gamma Specialty</b>

01:52.210 --> 01:53.040
<b>Hot Spring Buns</b>

01:53.290 --> 01:56.880
Hey! Don't eat all the souvenir snacks yourself!

01:56.880 --> 01:58.250
Ya snooze, ya lose...

01:58.250 --> 01:59.080
I want some of 'em, too!

01:59.080 --> 02:00.710
Whoa, hey-
I want some of 'em, too!<b></b>

02:04.830 --> 02:08.580
Pay attention, Zenia.
I shall be away for two days.

02:08.580 --> 02:12.290
While I'm gone, I need you to
investigate the Bureau of Magic,

02:12.290 --> 02:14.330
the agency where Fred works.

02:14.330 --> 02:16.170
Of course. Understood, milord.

02:16.170 --> 02:17.710
Leave it to me.

02:20.540 --> 02:22.420
So this is the Bureau of Magic...

02:22.670 --> 02:25.750
In charge of producing the
Kingdom's magic-based energy,

02:25.750 --> 02:28.670
it's also where the associated military
and political factions are administered.

02:27.830 --> 02:31.540
<b>Bureau of Magic</b>

02:28.670 --> 02:30.710
An important government institution.

02:33.920 --> 02:37.460
It makes sense that His Grace would
ask me to investigate this place.

02:37.460 --> 02:40.580
I must accomplish my mission,
no matter what it takes!

02:41.670 --> 02:44.040
I cannot simply waltz through the front door.

02:44.040 --> 02:46.920
However, I wouldn't want to be
mistaken for an ordinary secretary.

02:47.500 --> 02:49.880
I'll go around back where
there are fewer windows...

02:53.790 --> 02:56.040
Zenia's Seven Special Spy Tools:

02:56.040 --> 02:57.380
Grappling Hook!

02:59.670 --> 03:00.330
GO!

03:03.880 --> 03:04.790
Perfect!

03:06.000 --> 03:09.420
To remain inconspicuous,
I'll infiltrate the building from the roof.

03:09.420 --> 03:11.210
These are the basics of being a spy!

03:11.210 --> 03:12.380
The heck is that...?

03:15.210 --> 03:17.000
As for the roof access...

03:17.000 --> 03:18.960
Locked, just as I suspected.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.210
This looks like a job for...

03:20.210 --> 03:23.250
Spy Tool #2: The Lock-Picker!

03:25.670 --> 03:28.960
With this, I should be able to...

03:29.830 --> 03:30.670
...THERE!

03:32.130 --> 03:33.630
Infiltration complete.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.880
Huh? Who're you?

03:40.040 --> 03:40.960
Sleep!

03:41.540 --> 03:43.920
Witnesses must be eliminated on sight.

03:43.920 --> 03:45.830
Another cardinal rule of being a spy.

03:46.040 --> 03:48.790
But I can't forget what His Grace
once told me...

03:49.330 --> 03:52.580
Humans are not the same as us demons.

03:52.580 --> 03:55.210
They shall never awaken from
death's sweet slumber.

03:55.580 --> 03:57.880
You mustn't kill them so hastily.

03:57.880 --> 03:59.080
Is that clear?

03:59.080 --> 04:01.250
You're the coolest, milord!

04:03.500 --> 04:05.210
You should be grateful to His Grace.

04:07.000 --> 04:09.000
You'll live to see another day.

04:12.170 --> 04:13.460
Oh, excuse me.

04:13.460 --> 04:14.420
Wait, who are-

04:14.420 --> 04:15.250
Sleep!

04:17.210 --> 04:19.960
I'm running into more obstacles
than anticipated...

04:21.040 --> 04:23.670
From this point on, I'll travel by air vent.

04:24.000 --> 04:26.170
The whole reason I came here
was to gather intel...

04:26.170 --> 04:27.960
And what better place to find intel

04:27.960 --> 04:32.170
than an archive or a server room
containing their computers?

04:32.460 --> 04:34.580
I'll start my search in this area.

04:33.170 --> 04:34.790
<b>Spy Tool #3:</b>

04:33.170 --> 04:34.790
<b>Energy Jelly Pack</b>

04:36.130 --> 04:38.750
If I return to the apartment with
the Magic Bureau's data in hand,

04:38.750 --> 04:41.250
His Grace is sure to be delighted!

04:42.670 --> 04:43.790
Cafeteria...

04:44.500 --> 04:45.630
Bathroom...

04:50.080 --> 04:52.540
Found it! The server room!

04:54.290 --> 04:55.750
Ugh, it's freezing...

04:55.750 --> 04:57.580
One staff member...

04:57.830 --> 04:59.710
I'll have to take care of him first.

04:59.710 --> 05:02.330
Spy Tool #4: Blow Dart Tranquilizer!

05:07.210 --> 05:08.040
What's this...?

05:08.040 --> 05:09.000
SURPRISE!

05:09.000 --> 05:10.040
Take this!

05:13.250 --> 05:14.630
There we go.

05:14.630 --> 05:16.460
Now the real work begins.

05:17.210 --> 05:18.920
Spy Tool #5:

05:19.420 --> 05:21.250
Hacking Software.

05:22.250 --> 05:25.210
It's going to take a long time
to download all this data...

05:25.210 --> 05:27.920
Maybe I oughtta focus on
the relevant stuff...

05:28.210 --> 05:30.040
Lots of emails in here...

05:31.000 --> 05:32.960
"Travel expenses are
the individual's responsibility"...

05:32.960 --> 05:35.380
"Smartphones must be charged at home"...

05:35.710 --> 05:37.330
That's awfully stingy of them...

05:38.920 --> 05:40.080
This one's from today.

05:40.420 --> 05:42.830
"Vodka and the Royal Army soldiers
who accompanied him

05:42.830 --> 05:46.330
during the Gamma Republic invasion
were forced to retreat.

05:46.330 --> 05:49.080
We were correct in assuming that our
usual strategy would prove inadequate.

05:49.460 --> 05:50.790
The key to success is-"

05:55.000 --> 05:57.040
So you're the reason.

05:57.040 --> 06:00.920
I was beginning to get a headache,
not unlike when a storm rolls in.

06:01.830 --> 06:04.830
What are you doing here, demon?

06:05.630 --> 06:07.630
Spy Tool #6:

06:07.630 --> 06:08.790
Smoke Bomb!

06:14.250 --> 06:15.170
GOTCHA!

06:20.210 --> 06:22.290
I don't appreciate your foolishness...

06:22.750 --> 06:25.170
...but I can use it to my advantage.

06:34.040 --> 06:36.630
My deepest apologies, Chief Secretary Fred.

06:36.630 --> 06:39.580
For allowing a suspicious individual
to infiltrate the building.

06:39.580 --> 06:42.040
I'll go ahead and contact the police-

06:42.040 --> 06:43.330
Oh, there's no need.

06:43.330 --> 06:44.170
Sir?

06:44.500 --> 06:46.330
Go wait outside.

06:46.330 --> 06:48.000
And don't let anyone in.

06:51.630 --> 06:53.170
Now then...

06:53.170 --> 06:56.080
Why don't you just sit back and answer
a couple of questions for me, hm?

06:56.460 --> 06:58.080
First, what's your name?

06:58.080 --> 07:00.710
I am a proud member of the demon race!

07:00.710 --> 07:02.460
I will not identify myself to a lowly human!

07:02.460 --> 07:04.830
Ah, so you ARE a demon!

07:04.830 --> 07:07.130
I've got my confirmation. Thanks.

07:07.380 --> 07:08.790
C-crap!

07:09.500 --> 07:11.330
This brings back memories.

07:11.330 --> 07:14.880
I saw a lot of demons during
the war ten years ago, but...

07:14.880 --> 07:17.630
I've never seen one as cute as you before.

07:17.630 --> 07:19.460
Wh-what's that supposed to mean?!

07:19.460 --> 07:21.170
I won't fall for your flattery!

07:21.790 --> 07:23.290
Sorry, had to try.

07:23.710 --> 07:26.420
Where do you live?
What do you do for a living?

07:26.710 --> 07:29.830
Alright, that's enough!
You're mocking me, aren't you?!

07:29.830 --> 07:32.130
If you're going to kill me,
then do it already!

07:32.500 --> 07:36.540
I, Zenia, would DIE before I ever
gave up my pride as a demon

07:36.540 --> 07:38.420
and surrendered to the likes of a human!

07:38.420 --> 07:40.880
Gotcha... So your name's Zenia...

07:41.380 --> 07:42.380
Dammit!

07:42.380 --> 07:43.710
That's so unfair!

07:43.710 --> 07:46.580
Quit asking me all these trick questions!

07:46.790 --> 07:48.790
Oh, by the way, my name's Fred.

07:48.790 --> 07:51.670
I'm the Chief Secretary of
the Bureau of Magic.

07:52.250 --> 07:54.420
I should've introduced myself first.

07:54.420 --> 07:55.790
My apologies again.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.580
I already know who you are!

07:57.580 --> 07:59.290
Alongside the Hero and
his other companions,

07:59.290 --> 08:01.830
you're a threat to His Grace
and the demon race!

08:01.830 --> 08:04.330
Our most reviled enemy!

08:04.880 --> 08:07.380
"His Grace"... The Demon Lord?

08:07.380 --> 08:09.830
Enemy or not, his skills were impressive.

08:09.830 --> 08:11.880
So you're here on the Demon Lord's orders?

08:12.710 --> 08:14.920
N-no, not at all...

08:14.920 --> 08:18.040
His Grace has been asleep ever since
you defeated him in the war...

08:18.040 --> 08:21.710
It was my own curiosity
that got the better of me, and... uh...

08:21.710 --> 08:24.460
Huh... It's weird, Zenia.

08:24.750 --> 08:28.170
I get the feeling that I've seen you
somewhere before...

08:28.170 --> 08:29.670
Now what trick are you trying to pull?

08:29.670 --> 08:31.540
You won't get any more information out of me!

08:32.040 --> 08:34.460
Where could it have been...?

08:34.460 --> 08:35.500
Oh, that's right!

08:35.500 --> 08:37.830
I remember where it was.

08:38.500 --> 08:39.500
See?

08:40.630 --> 08:43.080
Right here. That's you, isn't it?

08:45.210 --> 08:47.170
Wait, where'd you get that photo?!

08:47.170 --> 08:49.630
Were you hiding in the bushes
or something?! Pervert!

08:49.630 --> 08:51.500
An article from a suburban news website.

08:51.500 --> 08:52.750
A fairly recent one.

08:52.750 --> 08:55.710
Prancing through the streets in
your birthday suit? Very bold.

08:55.710 --> 08:59.250
You don't understand!
I got kind of drunk, and I just...!

08:59.250 --> 09:03.420
I get it. It's easy to get carried away
when there's alcohol involved.

09:03.670 --> 09:05.630
You must've had a good time!

09:05.630 --> 09:07.920
Just wish I'd been there to see it...

09:07.920 --> 09:14.460
<b>Max the Hero Plays Nighttime Tag with Naked Woman?</b>

09:08.420 --> 09:11.460
So, were you drinking with
the guy running away from you?

09:12.210 --> 09:14.460
U-um... yes...

09:14.630 --> 09:17.130
Well, he's a real piece of work.

09:17.130 --> 09:21.580
Getting you hammered and then refusing
to take responsibility for his actions...

09:21.580 --> 09:23.580
I don't know who the hell he is...

09:23.580 --> 09:26.540
but he's a lousy, pathetic creep.

09:26.540 --> 09:29.130
You shouldn't hang around
guys like that, Zenia.

09:30.380 --> 09:32.790
How'd you even meet him in the first place?

09:32.790 --> 09:36.880
O-oh, uh... I was drunk,
so it's all sort of a blur...

09:37.170 --> 09:40.670
Ah... Then was this the only time
you ever saw him?

09:40.670 --> 09:42.040
Yeah.

09:42.040 --> 09:44.750
N-not that anything happened between us...

09:44.750 --> 09:46.250
Thank goodness!

09:46.250 --> 09:49.080
You have no idea how relieved
I am to hear that.

09:49.080 --> 09:53.330
I can't stand the thought of that sleazy old
scumbag preying on a nice girl like you.

09:55.080 --> 09:58.750
Oh, no! I-I'd never get involved
with someone like-

10:02.960 --> 10:05.210
Enough with the innocent act, Zenia.

10:06.960 --> 10:09.330
Do you really think I'm that clueless?

10:10.540 --> 10:11.960
Answer me.

10:11.960 --> 10:14.960
Why get close to Max?
What's the end goal?

10:15.750 --> 10:16.670
Well?

10:17.210 --> 10:19.710
You filthy, disgusting demons!

10:19.710 --> 10:22.080
Why are you trying to get on his good side?!

10:22.080 --> 10:23.080
TALK!

10:28.580 --> 10:29.580
Um...

10:31.130 --> 10:32.540
Chief Secretary Fred?

10:32.540 --> 10:35.130
Minister Grimms is here to see you.

10:35.130 --> 10:36.580
Tell him to wait.

10:36.580 --> 10:38.040
B-but sir...

10:38.040 --> 10:41.290
he says he has something
important to discuss.

10:41.290 --> 10:43.130
He's requesting an audience with you...

10:44.750 --> 10:48.540
Those handcuffs are designed to
suppress the wearer's magic.

10:48.540 --> 10:51.710
Which means you can't use
your demonic powers.

10:52.170 --> 10:54.130
So don't even THINK about
trying to escape.

10:55.500 --> 10:56.630
Chief Secretary...

10:56.630 --> 10:59.040
I mean it. Don't alert the authorities.

10:59.380 --> 11:02.420
Keep a close eye on her
until I get back, Lim.

11:10.670 --> 11:12.830
Oh, Chief Secretary Fred!

11:12.830 --> 11:15.580
I'm so sorry to interrupt
your busy schedule, sir...

11:15.580 --> 11:16.750
Not at all.

11:16.750 --> 11:19.630
It appears His Excellency
is staying busy, too.

11:19.630 --> 11:21.380
Lemme take you out sometime.

11:21.380 --> 11:23.290
I know a fantastic restaurant.

11:23.290 --> 11:26.330
I-I couldn't!
But I'm extremely flattered!

11:27.210 --> 11:30.960
Your Excellency! Chief Secretary Fred
is here to see you, sir!

11:31.830 --> 11:33.830
Fred, my boy!

11:34.080 --> 11:36.380
It's been FAR too long!

11:36.710 --> 11:38.920
A personal visit from the
Third Minister himself?

11:38.920 --> 11:41.130
You honor me, Lord Grimms.

11:43.040 --> 11:45.880
I see you've mastered the art of ass-kissing.

11:46.040 --> 11:47.670
Oh, I'm so proud!

11:51.960 --> 11:54.580
What in the world is the
Chief Secretary thinking...?

11:54.580 --> 11:56.170
Who ties someone up in their office,

11:56.170 --> 11:59.040
interrogates them,
and refuses to call the police?

11:59.040 --> 12:00.880
He's holding this woman hostage...

12:01.710 --> 12:03.750
God, I screwed up!

12:03.750 --> 12:06.580
Getting captured AND spilling the beans...?

12:07.210 --> 12:10.420
I must conceal the fact that His Grace
has been reborn at all costs!

12:10.420 --> 12:12.420
He's only been awake for a short time...

12:12.420 --> 12:15.460
If a fight broke out, he would be
at a HUGE disadvantage!

12:15.830 --> 12:18.750
Either way... I need to focus on
getting out of here first!

12:19.920 --> 12:21.670
Um, excuse me...?

12:22.630 --> 12:23.750
What's the matter?

12:24.630 --> 12:28.960
I-I have to go to the bathroom...

12:29.580 --> 12:30.710
Fine.

12:38.040 --> 12:40.790
Sorry for droppin' in on ya
without an appointment.

12:40.790 --> 12:41.880
How ya been?

12:41.880 --> 12:44.000
Please keep it brief, Your Excellency!

12:44.000 --> 12:48.330
The Chief Secretary is a very busy man,
and you're wasting his precious time.

12:48.710 --> 12:50.710
Let's take a picture, eh?

12:50.710 --> 12:52.040
Say cheese, Fred!

12:52.710 --> 12:54.170
Your Excellency, please...!

12:54.170 --> 12:55.920
Look, it came out great!

12:54.170 --> 12:55.920
<b>Grimms·the third</b>

12:54.170 --> 12:55.920
<b>At the Magic Bureau!</b>

12:54.170 --> 12:55.920
<b>Enjoy my selfie with the Chief Secretary~</b>

12:55.920 --> 12:58.460
And what a beautiful smile!
That's our Chief Secretary for ya!

12:58.830 --> 13:02.040
Like it? It's a filter that changes
your facial expressions.

13:02.040 --> 13:04.250
My sincerest apologies, Chief Secretary...

13:04.250 --> 13:06.250
Don't you DARE post that on social media!

13:06.250 --> 13:08.880
The last time your schedule leaked,
it blew up online!

13:08.880 --> 13:10.790
Too late, already posted it!

13:14.290 --> 13:15.670
Ya look like crap.

13:18.500 --> 13:20.880
Still worried? About Leo, I mean.

13:20.880 --> 13:22.750
Worried...?

13:22.750 --> 13:24.710
Well, as far as the effect he has

13:24.710 --> 13:27.500
on the Kingdom's reputation
and economic interests, I sure am.

13:28.330 --> 13:30.540
Makes ya miss how things were
a decade ago...

13:30.540 --> 13:32.460
even if we were poorer.

13:33.210 --> 13:35.960
The Hero and his pals
defeated the Demon Lord,

13:35.960 --> 13:38.670
and the whole country was on cloud nine.

13:39.880 --> 13:42.880
I wonder how Max is doin' nowadays...

13:42.880 --> 13:45.290
You ever talk to him, Fred?

13:45.540 --> 13:46.960
No, I don't...

13:46.960 --> 13:48.580
He's not the same as he used to be.

13:48.580 --> 13:49.880
That's too bad...

13:49.880 --> 13:51.080
Your Excellency...

13:51.080 --> 13:53.710
Why don't we discuss this
over lunch some other time?

13:53.710 --> 13:55.880
Ah, you're right! My bad.

13:55.880 --> 13:57.830
I should cut to the chase, shouldn't I?

13:57.830 --> 13:59.540
Please don't be mad!

14:01.460 --> 14:02.380
Good grief...

14:02.380 --> 14:05.540
I sincerely hope you've learned your lesson
about tresspassing on government property.

14:05.540 --> 14:06.830
I'm ashamed of myself...

14:07.500 --> 14:09.920
Are you okay? Sit down nice and easy...

14:09.920 --> 14:10.830
There.

14:10.830 --> 14:12.580
U-um, my jumpsuit...

14:12.580 --> 14:14.790
Right. I'll unzip it for you.

14:14.790 --> 14:16.710
You picked the world's most
inconvenient outfit...

14:17.290 --> 14:19.420
Feel better? Do I need to wipe you dry?

14:19.420 --> 14:22.580
Oh... the bidet, please. On low.

14:22.580 --> 14:24.880
You're awfully demanding for a female spy...

14:25.830 --> 14:27.830
Thank you... very much!

14:31.080 --> 14:33.210
When Fred comes back, I'm in trouble.

14:33.210 --> 14:36.210
There's a chance he'll find out
about His Grace this time...

14:36.210 --> 14:38.420
I MUST escape before that happens!

14:40.210 --> 14:41.880
Here, open wide.

14:44.130 --> 14:45.960
What do you want next?

14:46.330 --> 14:49.330
Uh... asparagus and some bacon, please.

14:49.330 --> 14:51.580
Fine, coming right up...

14:51.960 --> 14:55.460
If I'm going to escape, I'll have to do
something about this woman...

14:56.250 --> 14:58.080
I feel terrible about it though...

14:59.170 --> 15:02.170
First, I want to thank you for
letting me borrow Vodka.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.250
In the end, well...
you know what happened.

15:05.250 --> 15:08.040
But luckily, I've been told his injuries
aren't life-threatening.

15:08.250 --> 15:12.250
Still, I can't help but wonder
how things got this bad...

15:13.040 --> 15:15.420
The blame rests solely on Leo's shoulders.

15:15.420 --> 15:18.080
If that moron hadn't decided
to be a selfish jerk...

15:18.080 --> 15:21.330
But Mr. Hippie did hit the jackpot
with his Gamma District.

15:21.330 --> 15:24.710
Him and his buddies found that
giant mine full of magic ore.

15:24.710 --> 15:28.630
If the Kingdom were to extend its gracious
hospitality and absorb the territory...

15:28.630 --> 15:32.830
If we did that, it would destroy
the Kingdom's reputation.

15:32.830 --> 15:35.080
Leo refused to admit that he took bribes.

15:35.080 --> 15:37.790
Then he doubled down and
defected out of the blue.

15:37.790 --> 15:41.330
That's not the kind of thing
we can just forgive and forget.

15:41.710 --> 15:43.170
Fred, my boy...

15:43.170 --> 15:46.170
Do you really believe Leo's
the type of guy to take bribes?

15:47.040 --> 15:51.290
Well, I'm not sure he has enough brain cells,
if we're being honest.

15:51.290 --> 15:53.000
I thought the same thing.

15:53.000 --> 15:54.630
Somebody framed Leo.

15:54.630 --> 15:56.170
I feel bad for him...

15:56.170 --> 15:58.000
Even if that's true,

15:58.000 --> 16:01.500
his defection was self-serving
and egotistical, end of story.

16:01.500 --> 16:03.080
You've got a point...

16:03.080 --> 16:07.920
He was loyal to the kingdom,
but it stabbed him in the back.

16:07.920 --> 16:10.420
That probably cut him to the quick,
and he just couldn't bear it.

16:11.000 --> 16:12.920
He's a man of integrity.

16:12.920 --> 16:15.420
If ya ask me, it's pretty impressive...

16:15.420 --> 16:17.460
Kind of. Just kidding...

16:17.790 --> 16:19.750
People who ride the moral high horse

16:19.750 --> 16:23.170
will demand that everyone around them
share in the same ideals.

16:23.420 --> 16:25.670
The Gamma Republic is destined to fail.

16:25.670 --> 16:27.380
That's all there is to it.

16:27.380 --> 16:29.000
Oh jeez...

16:29.500 --> 16:32.540
Then I don't think you're going to like
what I'm about to say...

16:33.880 --> 16:35.290
The truth is...

16:35.290 --> 16:39.210
I'm toying with the idea of proposing
a peace treaty with the Gamma Republic.

16:39.210 --> 16:40.170
What?

16:40.170 --> 16:42.630
Lots of people sympathize with
Leo and the Republic,

16:42.630 --> 16:44.750
even some of the Kingdom's citizens.

16:44.750 --> 16:46.080
If we go the peaceful route,

16:46.080 --> 16:48.290
I think I'd be able to drum up
a decent amount of support.

16:48.630 --> 16:51.040
And, most importantly,

16:51.040 --> 16:54.330
the Gamma Republic has yet to cause
any direct harm to the Kingdom, right?

16:54.330 --> 16:56.330
Outside of self-defense, that is.

16:56.330 --> 17:01.290
The global community's perception of the
Kingdom keeps on getting worse over time.

17:01.290 --> 17:04.880
Of course, recognizing them as an
independent country is a different story.

17:05.250 --> 17:07.670
We'd just have each side make
a couple of concessions.

17:07.670 --> 17:11.000
I'd rather settle this mess without it
turning into a fight, y'know?

17:11.000 --> 17:12.330
What are your thoughts?

17:12.670 --> 17:15.000
Are you being serious right now?

17:15.000 --> 17:16.630
What do the other ministers think?

17:17.000 --> 17:18.670
The old lady's on board.

17:18.670 --> 17:20.790
She's always had a soft spot for Leo.

17:20.790 --> 17:22.710
As for the rest...

17:22.710 --> 17:24.880
well, I gotta work on convincing them.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.380
One step at a time, right?

17:26.790 --> 17:28.040
But before anything else,

17:28.040 --> 17:29.830
I was thinking we ought to put

17:29.830 --> 17:33.290
a temporary hold on all military
operations at the border.

17:33.290 --> 17:36.040
My long-term goal is to establish
a strategic alliance.

17:36.040 --> 17:38.630
One that's practical, peaceful,
and constructive.

17:39.170 --> 17:43.000
And your help is crucial
to achieving that, Fred.

17:43.000 --> 17:44.630
You're Leo's friend...

17:45.000 --> 17:48.210
AND you're a big hit with the public.

17:55.380 --> 17:56.830
I've got no choice...

17:56.830 --> 18:00.380
Either way, I have to get these
magic-suppressing handcuffs off first!

18:00.790 --> 18:03.040
There's one detail
Fred failed to account for:

18:03.040 --> 18:05.330
I can't even use magic.

18:05.540 --> 18:08.210
This is exactly the kind of situation
I prepared for!

18:08.210 --> 18:12.540
Hidden in my back pocket,
Spy Tool #7: Oil Slick!

18:12.540 --> 18:14.000
<b>Zenia's Special Brew</b>

18:18.500 --> 18:19.710
Perfect!

18:19.710 --> 18:22.040
And now... I slip right out!

18:22.880 --> 18:23.960
H-huh...?

18:24.580 --> 18:26.080
Uh, what are you doing?

18:27.040 --> 18:30.380
I-I was thirsty, so I decided to have
a refreshing sports drink!

18:30.380 --> 18:33.080
What kind of sports drink is this greasy?!

18:35.580 --> 18:36.880
Look...

18:36.880 --> 18:39.830
I'm an officer, and I report
directly to Chief Secretary Fred.

18:39.830 --> 18:42.500
I know a thing or two about magic myself.

18:42.500 --> 18:44.380
And while I would prefer NOT to,

18:44.380 --> 18:47.920
I won't hesitate to use force
if you make any sudden moves.

18:48.210 --> 18:50.420
I'm not taking you to the bathroom either!

18:50.880 --> 18:52.380
Are you listening to me?!

18:54.960 --> 18:57.000
That's not going to help you escape.

18:57.000 --> 18:58.420
Please just sit there and-

18:59.960 --> 19:00.880
What?!

19:08.830 --> 19:10.540
Nice! I'm free!

19:12.080 --> 19:13.960
I forgot about my feet...

19:14.460 --> 19:17.920
So you're not just some
dumb bimbo in a costume, eh...?

19:19.210 --> 19:20.540
C'mon...!

19:29.830 --> 19:32.580
Now I understand why
the Chief Secretary tied you up.

19:32.580 --> 19:35.040
You're a Class A security risk.

19:35.040 --> 19:37.000
You're not going anywhere.

19:40.670 --> 19:42.790
Can I count on your cooperation?

19:43.130 --> 19:44.460
Fred, my boy?

19:45.960 --> 19:47.210
Well...

19:49.460 --> 19:52.710
Who am I to deny
THE Honorable Lord Grimms?

19:52.710 --> 19:55.130
I'll do everything in my power to help.

19:56.250 --> 19:56.920
C'mere, ya tsundere little prince!

19:56.920 --> 19:58.880
Ouch! Ow-ow-ow!
C'mere, ya tsundere little prince!<b></b>

19:58.880 --> 20:01.080
I'm NOT a prince!
Noogie, noogie, noogie!<b></b>

20:01.500 --> 20:03.580
Ah, what a relief! I feel better.

20:03.580 --> 20:05.750
We'll talk details further down the road.

20:05.750 --> 20:08.000
And sorry again for bargin' in on ya!

20:08.000 --> 20:09.460
Yeah, you should be.

20:09.460 --> 20:11.170
Now please leave.

20:11.540 --> 20:14.630
Thank you for your time,
Chief Secretary.

20:14.630 --> 20:15.790
Laters!

20:20.460 --> 20:22.580
Heading out, Lord Grimms?

20:22.580 --> 20:24.630
Thanks for coming, Your Excellency!

20:24.630 --> 20:26.130
Sure thing. Bye!

20:28.830 --> 20:29.960
Preesh.

20:38.670 --> 20:40.580
You're strong, I'll give you that.

20:40.580 --> 20:43.210
Are you satisfied now, Miss Spy?

20:45.000 --> 20:46.330
No need to panic.

20:46.330 --> 20:48.710
These flames are under MY control,

20:48.710 --> 20:51.420
down to their temperature, the smoke,
and how fast they spread.

20:51.710 --> 20:53.080
I won't let you die.

20:53.080 --> 20:56.000
C-can't... breathe...

20:56.460 --> 20:58.380
Go ahead and lie down.

20:58.750 --> 21:00.460
I'm going to...

21:02.880 --> 21:04.710
Isn't this great, Your Excellency?

21:04.710 --> 21:06.460
Yup. But we've still got work to do.

21:09.170 --> 21:11.710
This is going to be stressful as hell...

21:11.710 --> 21:12.920
I swear...

21:20.420 --> 21:22.920
Now, what's up next on the schedule...?

21:22.920 --> 21:24.460
Let's see...
Hmm, I wonder if it got any likes...<b></b>

21:24.460 --> 21:25.420
Hmm, I wonder if it got any likes...

21:25.420 --> 21:29.000
First, you have a meeting with
Vice-Minister Melvin.

21:29.000 --> 21:30.830
After that, there's the annual Plum Blossom-

21:34.630 --> 21:35.420
Huh?

21:41.710 --> 21:43.710
D-did you see that, Your Excellency?!

21:43.710 --> 21:44.960
A-an explosion...

21:44.960 --> 21:46.670
at the Magic Bureau...!

21:46.670 --> 21:47.880
Oh my god!

21:48.630 --> 21:52.040
Well, don't stop.
You're putting us in danger.

21:52.330 --> 21:53.670
Hurry up and drive.

21:53.670 --> 21:55.460
I'd rather not get involved, y'know?

21:55.460 --> 21:56.630
Huh?!

21:56.790 --> 21:57.710
Right...

21:57.710 --> 22:00.380
Tsk, tsk. It's those damn terrorists.

22:00.380 --> 22:02.790
The Republic really screwed up this time.

22:03.670 --> 22:07.000
Now that oughtta turn up the pressure.

22:07.250 --> 22:10.380
What will you do... Fred the Cleric?
